    "research_area": "Droplet Combustion & Cool Flame Kinetics",
    "objectives": "Study fundamental spherical droplet combustion, radiative extinguishment, and low-temperature chemical reaction regimes (cool flames) in microgravity.",
    "description": "FLEX explores droplet burning behavior free from buoyant convection. Droplets suspended on SiC filaments burn with spherical symmetry. The discovery of quasi-steady low-temperature 'cool flame' burning after hot-flame extinction revolutionized combustion kinetics and clean fuel models.",
